# Hermes per-profile runtime state — bind-mounted into the container at
# /opt/data by deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml. Only the hand-written
# config.yaml and SOUL.md are checked in; everything else is generated
# by Hermes at runtime and is ephemeral to the dev machine.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*/config.yaml
!*/SOUL.md
!*/.env.example
# Allow nested profiles (e.g. profiles/example/alice/config.yaml)
!**/config.yaml
!**/SOUL.md
!**/.env.example
